{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p15857-78203e156b4ac6fb7832","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"오, 당신이었군요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6807336537711145082"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-8f35f19a93428fc64d7e","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"……나야","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1347642681825234643"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-c5115ec6aa294a4cc3b6","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"「아, 당신이었군요」","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["12185306700440336396"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-141d11879fc93a386ab5","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"(대충 손을 휘둘러 쫓아낸다)","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5183338832989441493"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-18ecde147ef4f43823ed","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"큭큭——뒤를 치지도 않고, 꼬리를 물고 늘어지지도 않고 이렇게 평온하게 인사를 나누다니, 좀 어색하네요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13058599332149147942"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-493c809b12c8e4fb0b23","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"또 무슨 짓을 꾸미고 있는 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2346789822333766695"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-9f6e176205e38f5ec8ff","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"어떤 일이든 충분한 휴식이 필요하죠. 이건 탈란톤께서 세상의 모든 생령에게 부여한 권리라고요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12035743274704963092"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-d4082001a2854a63b15d","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"그래서 보시다시피——쉬는 중이에요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4661178080985816975"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-ca07f731c6878890d2a1","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"내가 언제 네 꼬리를 물고 늘어졌다고 그래?","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["530084755451833203"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-fbcd9893f84b0db62fed","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"자그레우스 조상님께서는 「한 사람이 온 세계이고, 한 사람이 물고 늘어진 것은 모든 사람을 물고 늘어진 것」이라고 말씀하셨어요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7033562200030072224"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-15dac3f3c0f52cdd2f37","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"당분간 손을 씻고 제대로 된 일을 찾자고요——추천할 만한 일이 있을까요?","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3476947750642561638"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-e26e12e5af4da5e2418f","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"절도 방지 대사는 어때?","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["384721059886140246"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-ceefb8843f30c789e1f1","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"그들에게 보물을 전부 지하실에 넣으라고 가르치면, 복귀하고 나서 찾는 수고를 덜겠네요. 좋은 생각이에요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13409575097578685410"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-0c0186041798f7c1b33d","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"목욕탕 마스코트는 어때?","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7493579972436324342"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-062988e855c3d91934a4","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"그때 파구사 님은 저와 사이가 꽤 좋았죠. 그녀의 연회에서 제 축사는 늘 모두를 포복절도하게 했으니까요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4908600172190567056"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-cd91dd64bd51084e8cdb","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"큭큭——그들이 술을 마시고 정신을 잃을 때마다 전 파도 끝의 진주를 훔치곤 했어요. 그녀는 끝까지 알아채지 못했고, 파도 끝이 어째서 민둥산이 되었는지 의아해했죠","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5917938623534616997"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-825172107d2cd7abf30e","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"운반공을 하는 건 어때, 바트 어르신?","speaker":"","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5418215478958565706"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-b9807a8e16de3b8b5cdb","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"그걸 아직도 기억하세요? 물건을 한 곳에서 다른 곳으로 옮기는 일이니, 어쩌면 적성에 맞을지도 모르겠네요","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10301189410384037799"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-4c8f19b08f213ef46ce8","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"맑은 하늘, 푸른 풀, 산책하는 시민들… 자그레우스 조상님께서는 「한가로운 오후에는 생각하는 것조차 죄」라고 말씀하셨죠","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15580375347582833315","3601687335270102006"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-1eb9d69d117625fee925","entryId":"other-npc-p15857","chapterId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","text":"그 일은 일단 제쳐두고, 할 이야기가 있다면 말벗이 되어드리죠","speaker":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3198054627247545664"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12418638820118367406","1538204114484346335","9313931686318038767","8443769584280841521","2818472489364728373"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p15857","title":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","page":"「贼灵」巴特鲁斯","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p15857-78203e156b4ac6fb7832","rowId":"other-npc-p15857-78203e156b4ac6fb7832","missionId":"npc-p15857","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","sceneId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-06869f737f1aacf43a0ce9cb","page":"「贼灵」巴特鲁斯","revision":102554,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15857-8f35f19a93428fc64d7e","other-npc-p15857-c5115ec6aa294a4cc3b6","other-npc-p15857-141d11879fc93a386ab5"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-8f35f19a93428fc64d7e","rowId":"other-npc-p15857-8f35f19a93428fc64d7e","missionId":"npc-p15857","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","sceneId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-06869f737f1aacf43a0ce9cb","page":"「贼灵」巴特鲁斯","revision":102554,"location":[1,1,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["680fa65e7c61-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15857-18ecde147ef4f43823ed"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-c5115ec6aa294a4cc3b6","rowId":"other-npc-p15857-c5115ec6aa294a4cc3b6","missionId":"npc-p15857","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","sceneId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-06869f737f1aacf43a0ce9cb","page":"「贼灵」巴特鲁斯","revision":102554,"location":[1,1,"option",1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["680fa65e7c61-1"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15857-18ecde147ef4f43823ed"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15857-141d11879fc93a386ab5","rowId":"other-npc-p15857-141d11879fc93a386ab5","missionId":"npc-p15857","mission":"「도둑 유령」 바르톨로스","sceneId":"sc64ab4f23e9f8646","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-06869f737f